# Step 1: Origin
ashfall-lifepath-step1-kassik-title = Lowlands of Kassik
ashfall-lifepath-step1-kassik-desc = Scorched limestone and sand under claw: pity evaporates faster than sweat here.

ashfall-lifepath-step1-kirwani-title = Bio-chambers of Clan Kirwani
ashfall-lifepath-step1-kirwani-desc = Turbine hum and a pod serial number before your wings even hardened.

ashfall-lifepath-step1-damascus-title = Slums of New Damascus
ashfall-lifepath-step1-damascus-desc = Base of the spire, permanent damp, and heavy boots stamping overhead.

ashfall-lifepath-step1-graveyard-title = St. Anna Graveyard
ashfall-lifepath-step1-graveyard-desc = Drifting hulks of dead cruisers and strict rationing of every breath.

ashfall-lifepath-step1-subsector-title = Sub-sector 4 Well
ashfall-lifepath-step1-subsector-desc = Machine grease, whistling steam lines, and recycled nutrient paste.

ashfall-lifepath-step1-mining-title = Outer Ring Pits
ashfall-lifepath-step1-mining-desc = Heavy drill thrum and stone dust settled deep in your lungs since childhood.

# Step 2: Craft
ashfall-lifepath-step2-engi-title = Cold Steel
ashfall-lifepath-step2-engi-desc = Drawn to wiring and machine bolts since early childhood.

ashfall-lifepath-step2-atmos-title = Ear for the Void
ashfall-lifepath-step2-atmos-desc = You feel pressure leaks in the loop straight down your spine.

ashfall-lifepath-step2-med-title = Compound Fracture
ashfall-lifepath-step2-med-desc = You saw your first shattered bone far too early and refused to look away.

ashfall-lifepath-step2-sec-title = Steel Spine
ashfall-lifepath-step2-sec-desc = You learned early: if you do not strike first, they stomp you into the deck grating.

ashfall-lifepath-step2-serv-title = Dirty Work
ashfall-lifepath-step2-serv-desc = Without the ones scrubbing soot, this world drowns in filth within days.

ashfall-lifepath-step2-cook-title = Dividing Rations
ashfall-lifepath-step2-cook-desc = The smell of lard and salt is sacred as long as broth remains in the kettle.

# Step 3: Fracture
ashfall-lifepath-step3-pedant-title = Shut Down
ashfall-lifepath-step3-pedant-desc = When crisis strikes, your mind locks onto regulations and manuals.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-pedant-weakness = Freezes up when normal protocol collapses.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-daredevil-title = Snap
ashfall-lifepath-step3-daredevil-desc = Other people's hesitation infuriates you more than any disaster.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-daredevil-weakness = Violent outbursts and complete disregard for safety gear.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-paranoid-title = Distrust
ashfall-lifepath-step3-paranoid-desc = Every casual gesture looks like preparation for a knife in the back.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-paranoid-weakness = Deafening suspicion toward teammates.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-burnout-title = Burn Out
ashfall-lifepath-step3-burnout-desc = When disaster peaks, a cold empty quiet replaces every thought.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-burnout-weakness = Complete apathy during prolonged crises.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-stoic-title = Silence
ashfall-lifepath-step3-stoic-desc = Stone face even when the whole deck caves in around you.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-stoic-weakness = Refusal to call for backup.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-pragmatist-title = Calculate Margin
ashfall-lifepath-step3-pragmatist-desc = Every casualty is instantly reduced to an expense ledger balance.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-pragmatist-weakness = Cold calculation where mercy is needed.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-idealist-title = Blind Faith
ashfall-lifepath-step3-idealist-desc = Blind faith in procedure shatters against the very first ruthless command.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-idealist-weakness = Inability to accept ugly facts.

ashfall-lifepath-step3-diplomat-title = Maneuver
ashfall-lifepath-step3-diplomat-desc = Smooth over any dispute before anyone draws a sidearm.
ashfall-lifepath-step3-diplomat-weakness = Sweeping filth under the rug until it erupts.

# Step 4: Core Archetype
ashfall-lifepath-step4-balance-title = Equilibrium
ashfall-lifepath-step4-balance-desc = The world stands on a balance of forces, not on sentiment.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-balance-quirk = Quietly weighs odds before committing to any action.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-decay-title = Decay
ashfall-lifepath-step4-decay-desc = Everything rotted long ago, and you simply watch the collapse unfold.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-decay-quirk = Tired stare of someone who has already seen the worst.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-indifference-title = Indifference
ashfall-lifepath-step4-indifference-desc = Screaming does not bother you as long as it stays out of your work area.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-indifference-quirk = Ignores hysterical shouts and idle small talk.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-stubborn-title = Stubbornness
ashfall-lifepath-step4-stubborn-desc = You will not back down, even if your own bones break in the process.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-stubborn-quirk = Grits teeth and pushes forward despite direct warnings.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-predator-title = Predator
ashfall-lifepath-step4-predator-desc = In the dark, the one who strikes the throat first survives.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-predator-quirk = Keeps back against the bulkhead and watches hands closely.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-idealist-title = Idealist
ashfall-lifepath-step4-idealist-desc = Something human must endure in this ash, no matter the cost.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-idealist-quirk = Stands up for the weak even when it guarantees trouble.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-ghost-title = Ghost
ashfall-lifepath-step4-ghost-desc = Your name is on no roster, you simply walk right past.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-ghost-quirk = Avoids security camera lenses and paper logs.

ashfall-lifepath-step4-fatalist-title = Fatalist
ashfall-lifepath-step4-fatalist-desc = Whatever is bound to burn will burn without extra drama.
ashfall-lifepath-step4-fatalist-quirk = Calmly lights up during the height of an alert.

